 against the wooden background, rather than trying to run rembg which only separates foreground from background as a whole.\n\nI'll settle on a practical, runnable plan: segment the distinct colored blobs with OpenCV, animate them popping up one by one with MoviePy, and layer in synthetic sound effects with Pydub since no SFX pack was provided. Time to check the Python setup and start writing the full script.","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python --version","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking Python version","toolSummary":"Python setup check"}},{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0a1da317-8a4c-4e21-80c2-ef4667c39ddd/.user_uploaded/media_1789612217098.jpg","toolAction":"Viewing uploaded image","toolSummary":"Input image analysis"}}]}
