{"step_index":37,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-17T02:32:29Z","content":"While that installs, let me write the complete script. Since you don't have SAM installed (it needs PyTorch + GPU), I'll use **OpenCV contour detection** which works perfectly on cartoon images like yours — the colored blobs are clearly different from the wooden background.","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"copy \"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\0a1da317-8a4c-4e21-80c2-ef4667c39ddd\\.user_uploaded\\media_1789612217098.jpg\" \"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\popup-project\\input_image.jpg\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\popup-project","WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Copying input image","toolSummary":"Image file copy"}}]}
